 10	
 11	Supported tags:
 12	
 13	- `{{path.to.value}}` — HTML-escaped interpolation
 14	- `{{{path.to.value}}}` — unescaped interpolation
 15	- `{{#if path}}...{{else}}...{{/if}}` — conditional blocks
 16	- `{{#each path}}...{{else}}...{{/each}}` — array iteration, with `{{this}}` and `{{@index}}`
